[TITLE]
Issue #36 (USEPA #104): a drop grate on a circular pipe, an incompatible pair
;; CH (CIRCULAR) cannot host the drop grate: its usage is removed. CH2 (RECT_OPEN)
;; can, and stays in the Street Inlet Flow Summary.

